			"notes": "# 1.0.2 _For 1.19.4_\n\n## Changes\nThis update brings a couple of small fixes. The most notable change is to the cloaks as they now have a proper model and renderer.\nFor a full list of changes take a look at the [Changelog](https://github.com/moltenwolfcub/crafted_cuisine/blob/v1.0.2-1.19.4/CHANGELOG.md#102).\n\n## Download Instructions\nDownload `crafted_cuisine-fabric-1.0.2-1.19.4.jar` and put in your mods folder. (There are many tutorials online on how to setup and run a fabric client so just search for one.)\n\n**Requires:**\n- [Fabric](https://fabricmc.net/use/installer/)\n- [Fabric API](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api)\n- [Minecraft](https://www.minecraft.net)\n- [A computer](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Computer \"Do you really need this link?\")"
