			"notes": "# 1.0.1\n### _For 1.18.2_\n\n## Changes\n#### This update brings a couple of small fixes and improves compatibility. The most notable new feature is the 4 new rooms for the Blackstone fortress.\n#### For a full list of changes take a look at the [Changelog](https://github.com/moltenwolfcub/crafted_cuisine/blob/v1.0.1-1.18.2/CHANGELOG.md#101)\n\n## Download Instructions\nDownload `crafted_cuisine-forge-1.0.1-1.18.2.jar` and put in your mods folder.\nRequires:\n- [Forge](https://files.minecraftforge.net/net/minecraftforge/forge/)\n- [Geckolib](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib)\n- [Minecraft](https://www.minecraft.net)\n- [A computer](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Computer)\n\nOptional intergration:\n- [Just Enough Items](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jei)\n- [Create](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create)\n- [Biomes O'Plenty](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/biomes-o-plenty)\n- [Oh The Biomes You'll Go](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/oh-the-biomes-youll-go)\n- [Ecologics](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ecologics)\n- [Quark](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/quark)\n- [The Twilight Forest](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-twilight-forest)"
